Z||000000||BAM-BAM||12-04-2000||11:31 AM||||  This idea came to me while I was in the shower yesterday. Then I thought it was funny, but the more I thought about it I liked it. What if, we on the forum invested $100.00 a month each into a group account to buy GM stock. Every quarter roll the dividends into GM stock and keep investing. Let say that we could get 800 solid investers, that would be $80.000 dollars a month plus the rollover would add up to a board position in a little over a year. At this point now you have a voice in what ever GM does. Keep the investment going with compounded interest, in time you (we) own a good share of GM. Then we bring back the Mid engine aoutomobile, not neccessarily the Fireo but a distant cousin of the Fiero. More power, better ergonomics, upgraded suspension and so on, designed entirely by the Forum 800 commitee. What do you think? Phil could be our CEO,COO,CFO. We could devise commitees to elect a President, Vise President. Eventually, Vise President of Powertrain Applications, Vise President of Interior/Exterior Design, Vise President of Suspension Enhancement, Vise President of Vendor Relations (Parts man) and so on. Man just think we could market the new mid engine Pennock Forum Runner or PFR V8 or PFR 3800SC or PRF TT (twin turbo)  And I'm spent!!!<P> Peace B2 OUT!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Don B. <BR>85GT<BR>Eibach/KYB Susp.<BR>Mr.Mikes 500 series seats,headliner! MOMO Commando Steering Wheel, White Face Race Style Gauges And Soon To Be More!!! YEAH BABY-YEAH||||reg||12
