Z||000038||BAM-BAM||12-06-2000||11:15 PM||||  This is serious buisness, If the support is strong enough, lets pole the Forum on buying the rights to the Fiero. There should be plenty of diversity here to find the proper investment contacts to establish a group investment account with a buy in amount. From there we let the the investment manager handle the investment capitol, providing each and every investor in the group with a monthly statement of investment summary. This lets you know the amount taken in and the amount invested, the current dividend rate and the account growth summary. at a predetermined point (value) we approach the advisary with a rights buyout offer. There will undoubtrably be a counter offer and so on. Once the rights are purchased and all leagal documents are signed, we, the investors, begin the formation of "The Company" and it's infrastructure. All this while the investment continues to grow, growth is power, our power, the power to forge ahead.<BR>Remember this is an endeavor of love, not a get rich quick scheme. The profits will be there, but we must be patient and we must not act on frivolity. <P> I like this idea, I like the brainstorming that has already begun. An important note to remember; we all must be equals, no one has the sole power of decision. we act in a democratic manner where the majority rules. All options and decisions will be ratified by closed ballot. Equal investment for equal right, majority rules. it's very simple. NO DIMPLED BALLOTS!!!! J/K (LOL) Is this a serious quest? I want it to be. What a simple way for the have nots to be able to have. <P> One more note; there are those on this forum who may not be able to afford the investment capitol. There has to be a way in which the investment group could subsidize the not so financialy gifted among us. Remember we are only strong in numbers. Let's brainstorm on that one for a while. I would like to see everyone interested have the opportunity. Also, Maybe it would be a good idea to get a prelimenary figure on what exactly GM might want for these rights. OK, I'm drained.<P> Peace, B2 OUT!  ||||reg||7
