Z||000053||DaRkLoRD||12-10-2000||06:18 PM||||I don't have a lot of money.. but I'd be more than happy to donate some of my engineering or design skills to this project. I'm working on making a few Fiero accessories of my own, and I think I could manage to divert some of the funds to this..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>I think it might be cheaper in the long run to develop our own car though, instead of buying the rights to the Fiero.. honestly, I expect GM would want millions of dollars for the Fiero license, whereas we could start a new business for under $200k. The production wouldn't be very high at first, but I think we could manage...<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||3
